# Normalise line endings in the repository, not on check-out.
#
# This project ships JavaScript that a POSIX and a Windows host both run, and its
# own `tools/check-encoding.mjs` fails on a mixed-EOL tree. Without this file,
# `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default) rewrites every committed file to CRLF
# on checkout, so the same commit produces a different working tree per platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary or already-normalised on purpose.
*.tgz binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
